stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> PaperReady: create_paper
  PaperReady --> InProgress: start_attempt<br/>deadline = now + 180 min
  InProgress --> Submitted: submit_attempt
  InProgress --> AutoSubmitted: deadline + 20 s<br/>(cron or next request)
  Submitted --> Scored
  AutoSubmitted --> Scored
  Scored --> [*]: review with answers<br/>and solutions
  note right of InProgress
    save_answers = autosave (retry-safe)
    start_attempt again = resume
  end note
  note right of Scored
    submit again = same result
    key fix = admin regrade re-scores
  end note
